📱 PART 1: 24/7 AI WhatsApp Bot (Screen Recording Demo)
Is part me aap phone screen record karke bot ki powers dikhayenge:

1️⃣ Feature: Instant Natural Language Lead Extraction (NLP)
Screen par kya karein: WhatsApp par ek lamba message bhej kar dikhao:
👉 "Bhai Pune mein 2BHK chahiye 70-80 lakh tak Wakad mein, buy karna hai"
Kya dikhega: Bot normal bot ki tarah bekar sawal nahi puchega, balki turant reply karega:
🎯 Purpose: Buy
🏠 Property: 2 BHK
📍 Location: Wakad
💰 Budget: 70-80 Lakh
"Aapka Shubh Naam bata dijiye?"
Voiceover / Caption:
"Client ko form bharne ki zaroorat nahi — wo normal Hindi ya English me baat karega aur bot saari requirements auto-extract kar lega!"

2️⃣ Feature: Smart Indian Budget & Currency Parser
Screen par kya karein: Budget me likho: ₹75 Lakh, 1.5 Cr, ya 70-80L.
Kya dikhega: Bot automatically Indian currency formats (Lakh / Crore / Range) ko parse karke exact Min/Max numbers calculate karta hai.
3️⃣ Feature: Non-Destructive Field Editing
Screen par kya karein: Bot jab summary card dikhata hai, toh 2 (Edit) select karein aur sirf Budget ya Location change karein.
Kya dikhega: Pura flow restart nahi hota, sirf wahi ek field change hoti hai aur updated summary aa jati hai.
4️⃣ Feature: Lead Scoring Algorithm (HOT 🔥 / WARM 🟡 / COLD 🔵)
Screen par kya dikhayein: Database ya Admin alert me Lead Score: 100/100 (HOT 🔥).
Voiceover / Caption:
"Har lead qualify hoti hai! Ready-to-move aur verified budget wale clients ko bot turant 'HOT LEAD 🔥' tag karta hai taaki sales team unhe sabse pehle call kare."

5️⃣ Feature: 🛡️ Live Anti-Fraud Google 5-Star Review Engine
Screen par kya karein:
Lead confirm hote hi Vijay Ratna QR Poster deliver hota hai with 1-Tap Google direct review link.
WhatsApp par type karein: VERIFY ya done.
Bot instant reply karta hai: "🔍 Checking Google Reviews live from Google database..."
Bot Google Places API (New) se check karke confirm karta hai:
"⭐ 5-Star Review Verified on Google! VIP Benefits Unlocked!"
Voiceover / Caption:
"0% Fake Reviews! Fake screenshot ya jhoothi rating ko rokne ke liye bot direct Google ke live server se verify karta hai."

6️⃣ Feature: WhatsApp Mobile Admin CRM (No Laptop Needed!)
Screen par kya karein: Admin number se ye commands chala kar dikhao:
*/stats* ➡️ Total leads, Hot leads, Today's leads summary.
*/customers* ➡️ Recent verified buyers ki list.
*/checkreview Amit Verma* ➡️ Direct Google live review status.
*/delete 9890XXXXXX* ➡️ Customer moved to Trash Bin.
*/restore 9890XXXXXX* ➡️ Accidental delete instant restore!
1-Click WhatsApp Chat Link: Har lead notification me client ka direct link hota hai — bina number save kiye 1-tap me chat shuru!
🌐 PART 2: Real Estate Web Platform (Desktop Screen Recording)
Is part me aap browser me website (localhost/real-estate-platform) khol kar dikhayenge:

1️⃣ Property Showcase & Filter Engine
Kya dikhayein: Clean, modern homepage with hero search.
Filters: Buy/Rent, City, Locality (Wakad, Baner), BHK Type, Price Range slider.
RERA Verified Badges: Properties par RERA registration badge aur Tier-based featured badge.
2️⃣ Online Site Visit Booking System (modules/booking)
Kya dikhayein: Property page par "Book a Free Site Visit" button.
Customer date aur time slot choose karta hai aur booking confirm ho jati hai.
3️⃣ Invoicing & Brokerage Billing Module (modules/invoice)
Kya dikhayein: Admin panel se deal close hone par automated PDF / Digital invoice generation.
Brokerage percentage, GST calculation, customer details aur download/print invoice.
4️⃣ Market Trends & Real Estate Blog (modules/blog)
Kya dikhayein: Real estate market insights, property investment guides, aur SEO-optimized blogs.
5️⃣ Mobile PWA (Progressive Web App)
Kya dikhayein: Mobile browser me "Add to Home Screen" prompt — website ek native mobile app ki tarah install ho jati hai!
